        "chapter": 23,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "I have heard what the prophets said, that prophesy lies in my name, saying, I have dreamed, I have dreamed.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 50,
            "text": "Matt. 7:22 (21–23)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 23:25",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 23,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
        "text": "How long shall this be in the heart of the prophets that prophesy lies? yea, they are prophets of the deceit of their own heart;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 19
          },
          {
            "start": 77,
            "end": 85
          }
        ],
