        "verseNumber": 26,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 23:26",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 23,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "Which think to cause my people to forget my name by their dreams which they tell every man to his neighbour, as their fathers have forgotten my name for Baal.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 27,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 23:27",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 23,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "The prophet that hath a dream, let him tell a dream; and he that hath my word, let him speak my word faithfully. What is the chaff to the wheat? saith the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 118,
            "end": 120
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 28,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 23:28",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 23,
        "verse": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "Is not my word like as a fire? saith the Lord; and like a hammer that breaketh the rock in pieces?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 2
          },
          {
            "start": 65,
            "end": 69
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 29,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 23:29",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 23,
        "verse": 29
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore, behold, I am against the prophets, saith the Lord, that steal my words every one from his neighbour.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 23
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 30,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 23:30",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 23,
        "verse": 30
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, I am against the prophets, saith the Lord, that use their tongues, and say, He saith.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 12
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 31,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 23:31",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 23,
        "verse": 31
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, I am against them that prophesy false dreams, saith the Lord, and do tell them, and cause my people to err by their lies, and by their lightness; yet I sent them not, nor commanded them: therefore they shall not profit this people at all, saith the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 52,
            "text": "TG Dream."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 12
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 32,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
